            "review_title": "Review at Sapa Banana Leaf Halal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nur A\n12 contributions\n0\nPak Tam Halal Restaurant - Great Food, Mountain View & Prayer Room\nAug 2026 • Solo\nI had a wonderful meal at Sapa Pak Tam Halal Restaurant. The restaurant was formerly known as Sapa Banana Leaf Restaurant. It's located close the Sapa Center\n\nThe food was delicious with a wide variety of Asian dishes to choose from. The menu is available in multiple languages, so ordering was very easy.\n\nMy favorite part was the beautiful view of the mountains from the restaurant. Pak Tam also provides a spacious and clean praying room, which is so important for Muslim travelers like me.\n\nThe prices are very reasonable and the staff were friendly and welcoming.\n\nHighly recommended if you’re looking for halal food in Sapa!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nYou can pay with card but there are minimum payment 300K VND\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-28",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
