            "review_title": "Review at Sapa Banana Leaf Halal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Meowwww1968\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1698 contributions\n0\nFantastic halal Malaysian & Vietnamese restaurant!\nMar 2025 • Couples\nHaving been In Vietnam for around 5 days we were keen to have non Vietnamese cuisine. Being Malaysians we were very happy to discover a Malaysian eatery in Sapa. Communications via FB Messenger were easy. We booked an outdoor table and the view was fabulous. We ordered Chili Prawn, telur dadar (omelet), deep fried squid, orange juice, teh tarik and rice. The chili prawn was one of the best I’ve ever had, anywhere, even in Malaysia!! Prawns were large and fresh. Tip top flavour. Everything was authentic. The orange juice was too authentic though - typical Malaysian OJ - Diluted 🤭\nHalal, with a certificate.\nRead more\nWritten March 26, 2025",
